
                                        PC Is Slow 
                                  (Startup apps, disk, services)

      Issue (What the user sees/experiences):

System performance is noticeably slow
Applications take a long time to open or respond
High CPU, memory, or disk usage observed
System may freeze or lag during normal use

    Cause (Root cause or most likely cause):

Too many startup programs running at boot
High disk usage due to background processes
Unnecessary or misconfigured Windows services
Insufficient system resources (CPU/RAM usage)
System updates or background tasks consuming resources


    Steps / Resolution (Numbered steps, commands, settings):
Check system resource usage
Open Task Manager (Ctrl + Shift + Esc)
Review CPU, Memory, and Disk usage
Identify processes using excessive resources




